    "title": "6 leaders received awards as 'America's greatest living innovators' from Donald Trump. Only 1 is US-born | Hindustan Times",
    "text": "Who are the six innovators, and where were they born?\nOne of the interesting takeaways from the ceremony is that of the six tech titans recognised, five are foreign-born immigrants. Elon Musk, Sergey Brin, Jensen Huang, and Lisa Su were the recipients of the National Medal of Science. Michael Dell and Satya Nadella received the National Medal of Technology and Innovation.",
